{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0442_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0442_1000_p", "source_sha256": "43ba258c78fee362d8392688e698dcdd708009d013bd7af9353c2976b357cb7d", "ja": "おーい、真。次の定期公演についてなんだけど……。\nん？　……うわっ？", "zh": "喂——，真。关于下次的定期公演，我想问……  \n嗯？……哇！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0442_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0442_1001_006mak", "source_sha256": "2ca9a2d4486bf62964f280398dbd0b0a8e4156d597a0e004c136a42a6b7b8fd0", "ja": "それ！　鬼はー、そ・とーーっ！　やーりぃっ！\n……って、{$P$}！？", "zh": "就是那个！“恶鬼啊——出去——！”耶——！\n……咦，{$P$}！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0442_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0442_1002_006mak", "source_sha256": "10c1fc23282027a86013a5e969d3232659aff279015c24e282bbca67c10870fd", "ja": "ご、ごめんなさい！　鬼役の環達だと思って\n思いっきり豆投げちゃいました！", "zh": "对、对不起！我还以为是扮鬼的环她们，\n就用力把豆子扔过去了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0442_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0442_1003_p", "source_sha256": "e817c7a2a03c6f2c040c2cfee1f7fad0cd51bd9c2770236294948384dda3afe1", "ja": "ビ、ビックリした……。\n豆？　ああ、節分か。", "zh": "吓、吓了一跳……  \n豆子？啊，是节分啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0442_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0442_1004_006mak", "source_sha256": "6008ee5f753475fe4af5ffcebe145c1323b74e6518bbd1035d282e469144e637", "ja": "はい。桃子がお祖母ちゃんから豆をもらって、\nそれでみんなで撒こうよって話になって……。", "zh": "嗯。桃子从奶奶那里拿到了豆子，然后就说要不要大家一起撒豆子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0442_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0442_1005_006mak", "source_sha256": "e7a7a0e48c240c79f598625b5bb47d793be32d7c662df102abd55efc3d4d549d", "ja": "本当にごめんなさい……！\n変なところに当たったりしてませんか？", "zh": "真的很对不起……！\n有没有打到什么奇怪的地方？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0442_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0442_1006_p", "source_sha256": "f9fa653a8f82be209f547c97680be45b39a904a58240bd68db51ae378144b583", "ja": "それは大丈夫だよ。ビックリしただけだから。\nただ、後片付けは忘れないようにな。", "zh": "没关系的。只是被吓了一跳而已。\n不过，别忘了收拾残局。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0442_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0442_1007_006mak", "source_sha256": "8799ba6eab7f96552dd58f333601fced01e48b7bff75c76df46f50a77d159ae8", "ja": "はい、責任を持って、片付けまでしっかりやります！\n……あ、いま廊下を走っていったのは……！", "zh": "好的，我会负起责任，连收拾工作也会好好完成！\n……啊，刚才跑过走廊的是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0442_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0442_1008_006mak", "source_sha256": "a35eff913a20da56724cd152d3e7b6172b5d9cdb604c495510aeb77d6b1b3c7e", "ja": "待て、環……じゃなかった、鬼め～！\n今度こそ、鬼は外ーーっ！！", "zh": "等等，环……不对，鬼怪吃我一招～！\n这次一定要，鬼怪退散——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0442_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0442_1009_p", "source_sha256": "89bba2b7d26db6b2ba5fe08bc923af28ec3fb48d3ff97d0532100db712a90f2b", "ja": "（まあ、伝統の風習を大事にするのはいいことだよな。\n……あれ？　そういえば何しに控室に来たんだっけ？）", "zh": "（嗯，重视传统习俗总归是件好事。\n……咦？说起来，我到底是来休息室干什么来着？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
